# Frames for the metaphysics and Homestuck levels (frames.ath is kept separate). See ontology/SOURCES.md.
kripke S5_3 = all 3 reflexive+euclidean
kripke S4_3 = all 3 reflexive+transitive
claim valid S5_3 "<>p -> []<>p"
claim invalid S4_3 "<>p -> []<>p"
frame "Addison: upgrade asteroid for metaphysics (ontology/SOURCES.md)" reading "T, 4, B, 5 hold on exactly the reflexive, transitive, symmetric, euclidean relations on 3 and 4 worlds; S5 frames are the equivalences" -> metaphysics/metaphysics.ath label checked-finite reach 2 cost 80
frame "Lewis, On the Plurality of Worlds (1986), indexical actuality (metaphysics/BASE.md)" reading "no privileged world: an S5 frame, every world sees every world; axiom 5 valid on all S5 frames" -> 4 label checked-finite reach 1 cost 80
frame "Addison: a postmodern history, Lyotard 1979 (ontology/SOURCES.md; metaphysics/BASE.md)" reading "flat picture vs directed history: axiom 5 fails on an S4 frame, countermodel printed" -> 5 label checked-finite reach 2 cost 80
frame "Addison: the measure problem (cosmos/BASE.md; metaphysics/BASE.md)" reading "no privileged world to anchor probability over worlds; the cosmos toy shows the ordering decides it" -> none label open reach 2 cost 160
frame "Addison: a Homestuck ontology (homestuck/BASE.md sections 6 and 7)" reading "the alpha timeline is the unique branch where []c holds; doomed branches satisfy ~<>[]c" -> homestuck/timelines.ath label checked-finite reach 2 cost 80
frame "Addison: sync Homestuck with Car Seat Headrest (carseat/, homestuck/level.json)" reading "Twin Fantasy 2011 and 2018 as two points of one directed history, like a timeline and its retcon" -> none label open reach 1 cost 120
